.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5a/lb0ak1jny7dajx2rqg8th0hstkm6za7.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9D%E7%A5%9E.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5a/lb0ak1jny7dajx2rqg8th0hstkm6za7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凝神\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内没敌人，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%9B%E5%BC%93%E7%AE%AD%E6%89%8B\" title=\"角色图鉴库/王国军弓箭手\"><img alt=\"头像 王国军弓箭手.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a0/auyfyz01uk57z23nmwfkeggf24cy4qz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">王国军弓箭手</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%A6%E4%BC%BD%E5%8B%92\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伦伽勒\"><img alt=\"头像 伦伽勒.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/dc/s1bk0m2lj5bxpmhksm1nmgqccdtv0pd.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></